    "name": "AR Heart: Chambers, Valves, and Dual-Loop Blood Flow",
    "description": "Guided AR lab that transitions from exterior/cutaway heart orientation to a structural tour, dual-circuit color flow, step-by-step RBC tracing, ventricular wall thickness comparison, valve open/closed backflow prevention, two identification quizzes, and a recap of key concept areas. Rotations are supported; left/right are taught from the patient\u2019s perspective.",
